    {
      "text": "elect to abide the Lord’s coming because they are pure, D&C 35:21. these words are pure, D&C 41:12. the Lord will reserve unto himself a pure people, D&C 43:14. blessed are poor who are pure in heart, D&C 56:18. pure shall see God, D&C 97:16. Zion is the pure in heart, D&C 97:21. the Lord will raise up unto himself a pure people, D&C 100:16. pure in heart shall return and come to their inheritance, D&C 101:18. garments to be pure, D&C 109:76. pure knowledge shall greatly enlarge soul, D&C 121:42. the Lord will save all those who have been pure in heart, D&C 124:54. spirit is matter but more fine or pure, D&C 131:7. blessed are those who render service with pure heart, D&C 136:11. marvel not at these things, for ye are not yet pure, D&C 136:37.",
